message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
title: "Vagrant-Kubernetes-ROS2 Deployment"
abstract: "An open-source educational lab for ROS2 (Foxy, legacy) experiments on a multi-node Kubernetes cluster provisioned with Vagrant and VirtualBox (the included Kubernetes manifests start stress-ng workloads; cross-worker ROS 2 messaging has not been verified), with Weave Net CNI, a Prometheus/Grafana/Dashboard monitoring stack, and Jupyter-based data analysis."
type: software
